/** @page tokenizer_encoding_resultguide Encoding Result Fields

    @tableofcontents

    All encoding methods return a hash with the following fields:

    |!Field|!Type|!Description
    |\c input_ids|list\<int\>|Token IDs
    |\c token_type_ids|list\<int\>|Segment IDs (0 for first text, 1 for second)
    |\c attention_mask|list\<int\>|1 for real tokens, 0 for padding
    |\c tokens|list\<string\>|String representation of each token
    |\c offset_mapping|list\<list\<int\>\>|Byte-level (start, end) offsets in original text
    |\c special_tokens_mask|list\<int\>|1 for special tokens, 0 for content tokens
*/
